  "title": "MEMTRACE_TOKEN Anonymous Behavior",
  "content": {
    "type": "factual",
    "format": "markdown",
    "body": "If `MEMTRACE_TOKEN` is not provided, the system will maintain anonymous behavior, allowing access only to public workspaces. `list_workspaces` will return public repositories or an empty list."
